  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "I go to the library with my father after school. First, we return a book at the front desk. A helpful woman shows us how to use the computer. We search for a story about a child and a dog. The book is on a tall shelf near the window. My father takes it down so I can borrow it. My bag is heavy with books, so he carries it. We sit in a quiet corner and read together. I enjoy the story and want to come back soon.",
    "textZh": "放學後，我和爸爸去圖書館。我們先在前方櫃檯還一本書。一位樂於助人的女士教我們使用電腦。我們找一個關於孩子和狗的故事。那本書放在窗邊的高書架上。爸爸把它拿下來，讓我可以借閱。我的袋子裝著書很重，所以由他來提。我們坐在安靜的角落，一起閱讀。我很喜歡這個故事，想很快再來。",
